  "note": "Every production stage send, call, and send_any on 33d62a6f, plus StageRefs carried in those messages and the submit API. blocking false is a oneshot reply. Per-connection protocols are one node each; N copies share that shape. A child spawned with eff.stage inherits Effects.mailbox_size, which for manager's children is the graph default 10, while manager's own mailbox is 10+U+D.",
